  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまない\r\n２次審査は通過できなかった……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……そう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……早く、早く帰ってレッスンしましょう、\r\nプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ま、待て、どうしたんだ？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私の努力が足りなかったのよ、余計なことに気を取られて\r\n……もっと頑張れたはずだったのに――",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいか、落ち着くんだ。『W.I.N.G.』に出られないのは\r\n残念だけど、それがすべてじゃない",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……そうね\r\nありがとうプロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "大丈夫、もう落ち着いたわ\r\n取り乱したりしてごめんなさい……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私の実力が、まだ足りなかっただけ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……\r\nお願い、プロデューサー。今からレッスンに付き合って",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001040080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……私は、もっともっと努力をして\r\n魅力的なアイドルになるわ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300104/7013001040080"
  },
